Feature: Booking a Gate Slot
  As a truck driver, I want to book a gate slot for my container, so that I can drop it off at a set time without queueing.

Scenario Outline: Booking a Gate Slot
  Given the gate slot starts tomorrow at 10:00 with room for <truckCount> trucks
  And I am a driver
  When I book that slot for a valid container "<container>"
  Then the booking is confirmed with a reference

  Examples:
    | truckCount |
    | 1          |
    | 2          |

Scenario Outline: Booking a Gate Slot with Limited Capacity
  Given the gate slot starts tomorrow at 10:00 with room for <truckCount> trucks
  And I am a driver
  When I book that slot for container "<container>"
  Then the booking is refused because "SLOT_FULL"

  Examples:
    | truckCount |
    | 0          |

Scenario Outline: Booking a Gate Slot with Another Driver Already Booked
  Given another driver has booked that slot
  And I am a driver
  When I book that slot for container "<container>"
  Then their booking is refused because "DUPLICATE_ACTIVE_BOOKING"

  Examples:
    | container |
    | <container> |

Scenario Outline: Booking a Gate Slot with Another Driver Already Booked (Different Container)
  Given another driver has booked that slot for the same container
  And I am a driver
  When I book that slot for container "<container>"
  Then their booking is refused because "DUPLICATE_ACTIVE_BOOKING"

  Examples:
    | container |
    | <container> |

Scenario Outline: Checking in on Time
  Given the gate slot starts tomorrow at 10:00 with room for 1 truck
